{"title":"Career roadmap — Junior Design Strategist","role":"Junior Design Strategist","summary":"A Junior Design Strategist connects customer needs, business objectives, research, creativity and design to help organisations solve complex problems and create better products, services and experiences.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM","Course":"BBA – Innovation & Design Thinking"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a hybrid career. The strongest candidates understand design thinking + business strategy + user research + product thinking + visualisation + communication rather than focusing only on graphic design."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build design thinking, user research, business strategy, UX fundamentals and visual communication; enter as Junior Design Strategist/Design Researcher/UX Strategy Associate."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Progress toward Design Strategist, UX Strategist, Service Designer, Product Strategist or Innovation Consultant."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Lead strategic design projects, innovation programmes, service transformation and product strategy."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into Design Strategy Director, Head of Design Strategy, Innovation Director, Chief Experience Officer or independent innovation consultancy."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design + business foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of design thinking"},{"text":"Business fundamentals"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Creativity techniques"},{"text":"Problem framing"},{"text":"Observation techniques"},{"text":"Basic visual communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the design-thinking cycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Empathise","Define","Ideate","Prototype","Test","Iterate"]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop basic skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Miro/FigJam"},{"text":"Presentation design"},{"text":"Storyboarding"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — User research + strategic design"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User interviews"},{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Persona development"},{"text":"Customer journey mapping"},{"text":"Empathy mapping"},{"text":"Jobs-to-be-Done"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Stakeholder interviews"},{"text":"Problem statements"},{"text":"Ideation frameworks"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Usability testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UX fundamentals"},{"text":"Service design"},{"text":"Product strategy"},{"text":"Business model basics"},{"text":"Value proposition design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Strategy + innovation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design research"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Innovation strategy"},{"text":"Product discovery"},{"text":"Service blueprinting"},{"text":"Business model innovation"},{"text":"Customer experience strategy"},{"text":"Digital product strategy"},{"text":"Design sprints"},{"text":"Strategic storytelling"},{"text":"Workshop facilitation"},{"text":"Innovation portfolio management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User problem","Business opportunity","Solution concept","Prototype","Validation","Business case"]},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Industry-ready portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Build 3 strong case studies."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Customer Experience Transformation"},{"type":"p","text":"Research a real customer journey, identify pain points and redesign the experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — New Product Innovation"},{"type":"p","text":"Take an unmet customer need and develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Opportunity statement"},{"text":"Concepts"},{"text":"Prototype"},{"text":"User testing"},{"text":"Business model"},{"text":"Go-to-market concept"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Service Design Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Map an end-to-end service using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer journey"},{"text":"Service blueprint"},{"text":"Frontstage/backstage processes"},{"text":"Pain points"},{"text":"Improvement opportunities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Your portfolio should demonstrate how you think, not just how attractive your final designs look."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Important skills","Potential roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"UX Strategy"},{"text":"Research, UX, product thinking"},{"text":"UX Strategist"}],[{"text":"Service Design"},{"text":"Journey mapping, service blueprints"},{"text":"Service Designer"}],[{"text":"Product Strategy"},{"text":"Product discovery, market research"},{"text":"Product Strategist"}],[{"text":"Innovation Strategy"},{"text":"Ideation, trends, business models"},{"text":"Innovation Consultant"}],[{"text":"Customer Experience"},{"text":"CX research, journey design"},{"text":"CX Strategist"}],[{"text":"Design Research"},{"text":"Interviews, qualitative research"},{"text":"Design Researcher"}],[{"text":"Brand Strategy"},{"text":"Consumer insights, positioning"},{"text":"Brand Strategist"}],[{"text":"Digital Transformation"},{"text":"Business + technology + design"},{"text":"Transformation Consultant"}],[{"text":"Social Innovation"},{"text":"Human-centred problem solving"},{"text":"Social Innovation Consultant"}],[{"text":"Strategic Design"},{"text":"Business + design + research"},{"text":"Design Strategist"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Best internship environments"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design consultancies"},{"text":"UX agencies"},{"text":"Product companies"},{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"Innovation labs"},{"text":"Management consulting firms"},{"text":"Advertising/brand agencies"},{"text":"Digital transformation firms"},{"text":"Consumer companies"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"HealthTech"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Design research organisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship roles"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design Strategy Intern"},{"text":"UX Research Intern"},{"text":"Service Design Intern"},{"text":"Product Strategy Intern"},{"text":"Innovation Intern"},{"text":"Design Research Intern"},{"text":"UX Intern"},{"text":"Product Management Intern"},{"text":"Business Strategy Intern"},{"text":"Customer Experience Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What to learn"},{"type":"p","text":"During internships, get exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Client discovery"},{"text":"User interviews"},{"text":"Workshop facilitation"},{"text":"Research synthesis"},{"text":"Journey mapping"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Ideation"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"User testing"},{"text":"Business case development"},{"text":"Presenting recommendations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A good internship should allow you to participate from problem discovery through recommendation, not only visual execution."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Useful learning"],"rows":[[{"text":"Design Thinking"},{"text":"Human-centred design / design thinking programmes"}],[{"text":"UX Research"},{"text":"UX research courses"}],[{"text":"Service Design"},{"text":"Service design methodologies"}],[{"text":"Product Management"},{"text":"Product discovery and product strategy"}],[{"text":"Innovation"},{"text":"Innovation management"}],[{"text":"Business Strategy"},{"text":"Strategy fundamentals"}],[{"text":"UX Design"},{"text":"Figma + UX foundations"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Qualitative and quantitative research"}],[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"Generative AI for design and research"}],[{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Excel, Power BI and basic statistics"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, portfolio quality is generally more important than collecting certificates."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Design Strategist"},{"text":"Design Strategy Associate"},{"text":"Design Research Associate"},{"text":"UX Research Associate"},{"text":"UX Strategy Associate"},{"text":"Innovation Associate"},{"text":"Service Design Associate"},{"text":"Customer Experience Associate"},{"text":"Product Strategy Associate"},{"text":"Innovation Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design Strategist"},{"text":"UX Strategist"},{"text":"Service Designer"},{"text":"Product Strategist"},{"text":"Innovation Consultant"},{"text":"CX Strategist"},{"text":"Design Researcher"},{"text":"Brand Strategist"},{"text":"Product Discovery Lead"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Long-term"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Design Strategist"},{"text":"Design Strategy Lead"},{"text":"Innovation Manager"},{"text":"Design Director"},{"text":"Head of Design Strategy"},{"text":"Head of Innovation"},{"text":"Experience Director"},{"text":"Innovation Director"},{"text":"Chief Experience Officer"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG route","Best for"],"rows":[[{"text":"MBA Innovation & Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Innovation + business"}],[{"text":"MBA Strategy"},{"text":"Business strategy"}],[{"text":"MBA Marketing"},{"text":"Customer/brand strategy"}],[{"text":"MBA Product Management"},{"text":"Product strategy"}],[{"text":"M.Des. UX/Interaction Design"},{"text":"Deeper design specialisation"}],[{"text":"M.Des. Strategic Design"},{"text":"Strategic design"}],[{"text":"M.Des. Service Design"},{"text":"Service innovation"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Design / Innovation"},{"text":"Research + innovation"}],[{"text":"PGDM Innovation & Design Thinking"},{"text":"Business-oriented innovation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended route"},{"type":"p","text":"For business-oriented design strategy:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Innovation & Design Thinking","Design Strategy/UX Internship","Junior Design Strategist","Design Strategist","MBA/advanced specialisation","Design Strategy Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"For deeper design expertise:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA","UX/Service Design portfolio","M.Des.","Strategic Design/Service Design roles"]}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Useful master's areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"🇬🇧 UK"},{"text":"Design Strategy, Service Design, Innovation"}],[{"text":"🇺🇸 USA"},{"text":"Design Management, Strategic Design, Innovation"}],[{"text":"🇨🇦 Canada"},{"text":"Strategic Design, UX, Innovation"}],[{"text":"🇳🇱 Netherlands"},{"text":"Design Thinking, Strategic Design, Service Design"}],[{"text":"🇩🇪 Germany"},{"text":"Design Strategy, Innovation Management"}],[{"text":"🇫🇮 Finland"},{"text":"Service Design, Design Management"}],[{"text":"🇸🇪 Sweden"},{"text":"Strategic Design, Innovation"}],[{"text":"🇦🇺 Australia"},{"text":"Design Strategy, UX, Innovation"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For international programmes, a strong portfolio and documented design process can be more important than simply having a list of certificates."}]},{"heading":"Career progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Strategic design pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Junior Design Strategist","Design Strategist","Senior Design Strategist","Design Strategy Lead","Design Strategy Manager","Head of Design Strategy","Design Director / Experience Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Innovation pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Junior Design Strategist","Innovation Associate","Innovation Consultant","Innovation Manager","Senior Innovation Manager","Innovation Director","Head of Innovation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Product pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Junior Design Strategist","Product Strategy Associate","Product Strategist","Senior Product Strategist","Product Strategy Lead","Head of Product Strategy"]},{"type":"note","label":"Emerging specialisations","text":"2030–2040"},{"type":"h","text":"1. AI Product Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Design strategists will increasingly work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI products"},{"text":"AI assistants"},{"text":"Agentic systems"},{"text":"Human-AI interaction"},{"text":"AI workflows"},{"text":"Trust and transparency"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The focus will be how AI should be integrated into a useful human workflow, not merely adding an AI feature."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Service Transformation"},{"type":"p","text":"Organisations will redesign complete customer journeys across:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital","physical","human","AI channels"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"3. Strategic UX Research"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can accelerate research synthesis, but strategists will still need to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ask good questions"},{"text":"Identify bias"},{"text":"Interpret context"},{"text":"Understand human behaviour"},{"text":"Validate assumptions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Experience Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"The role will increasingly connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Brand","Product","Service","Customer Experience"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"5. Innovation Portfolio Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Large organisations will need professionals who evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emerging technologies"},{"text":"Customer trends"},{"text":"New business models"},{"text":"Innovation opportunities"},{"text":"Investment priorities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"and determine which ideas deserve resources."},{"type":"h","text":"6. Sustainable Design Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Growing emphasis on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Circular business models"},{"text":"Sustainable services"},{"text":"Responsible consumption"},{"text":"Climate-conscious product design"},{"text":"Social impact"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"AI will automate portions of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research synthesis"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Ideation"},{"text":"Persona generation"},{"text":"Prototype generation"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Presentation creation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But strategic design will remain valuable because organisations still need humans to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Define the right problem"},{"text":"Understand human motivations"},{"text":"Resolve stakeholder conflicts"},{"text":"Make strategic trade-offs"},{"text":"Decide which opportunities matter"},{"text":"Balance desirability, feasibility and viability"},{"text":"Navigate organisational change"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role therefore evolves from:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Helping design better products.\""},{"type":"p","text":"toward:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Helping organisations decide what should be designed, why it matters, and how it can create sustainable business and customer value.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design thinking"},{"text":"UX fundamentals"},{"text":"Service design"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Design research"},{"text":"Journey mapping"},{"text":"Service blueprinting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strategy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business strategy"},{"text":"Product strategy"},{"text":"Innovation strategy"},{"text":"Market analysis"},{"text":"Business models"},{"text":"Competitive strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User interviews"},{"text":"Qualitative research"},{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Usability testing"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Research synthesis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Miro/FigJam"},{"text":"AI design tools"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"Digital product fundamentals"},{"text":"Basic data analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Finance basics"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Product management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Workshop facilitation"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Strategic thinking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business fundamentals","Design Thinking","Figma"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 1"},{"type":"flow","items":["UX Research","Service Design","Prototyping"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 2"},{"type":"flow","items":["Innovation Strategy","Product Thinking","Business Models"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 3"},{"type":"note","label":"Final Year","text":"3–4 strong strategic design case studies + internship"},{"type":"note","label":"0–2 years","text":"Junior Design Strategist / UX Research Associate / Innovation Associate"},{"type":"note","label":"3–5 years","text":"Design Strategist / Service Designer / Product Strategist"},{"type":"note","label":"5–8 years","text":"Senior Strategist / Innovation Manager / Strategy Lead"},{"type":"note","label":"8–15 years","text":"Head of Design Strategy / Innovation Director / Experience Director"},{"type":"h","text":"Best employability combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Innovation & Design Thinking","strong portfolio","user research","business strategy","UX/service design","Figma","product thinking","AI tools","storytelling","internship."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"note","label":"Key principle","text":"A Junior Design Strategist should not be positioned as simply a designer. The real value is the ability to understand people, identify meaningful problems, connect them to business opportunities, develop and test solutions, and translate insights into strategic decisions."}]}]}